# The Mintlify site is ONLY docs/*.mdx plus docs.json. `mint` scans the whole
# working tree (including gitignored scratch like .venv/ and .superpowers/), so
# ignore everything, re-include just the docs dir + config, then drop the
# internal, non-MDX docs that live under docs/.
# .mintignore uses .gitignore-style patterns.
/*
!/docs/
!/docs.json

# Non-published markdown under docs/ (internal design docs + research notes)
/docs/*.md
/docs/specs/
/docs/plans/
/docs/runbooks/
/docs/superpowers/
